{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实战应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optuna-ax-platform","title":"Optuna 与 Ax 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/optuna-ax-platform","wordCount":1003,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-architecture-search","title":"神经架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/neural-architecture-search","wordCount":1853,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-world-applications","title":"工业应用案例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/real-world-applications","wordCount":1876,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实战应用\">实战应用</h1><p>理论和工程最终要落地到具体的平台与场景。本章首先对比 Optuna（v4.9，2026）和 Ax（v1.3.1，2026）两大主流贝叶斯优化平台的架构与使用方式，然后将超参数搜索的范式推广到神经架构搜索（NAS）这一更大的设计空间，最后通过推荐系统、材料科学和 LLM 微调等工业案例展示贝叶斯优化在真实生产中的价值。三篇文档的关系是&quot;工具 → 延伸 → 落地&quot;——掌握平台用法后扩展到 NAS 场景，再看实际项目如何将所有章节的知识融会贯通。</p>\n"}